      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: ₹0.30 loss per share (vs ₹0.17 profit in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: ₹0.30 loss per share (down from ₹0.17 profit in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹544.0m (down 73% from 3Q 2025). Net loss: ₹74.3m (down 270% from profit in 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 29 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
